[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3027054710","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108188#issuecomment-3027054710","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108188","id":3027054710,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60bTB2","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-02T09:03:42Z","updated_at":"2025-07-02T09:03:42Z","body":"Please provide an MRP to make this easier to test and fix:\n- A small Godot project which reproduces the issue, with no unnecessary files included. Be sure to not include the `.godot` folder in the archive (but keep `project.godot`).\n- Having an MRP is very important for contributors to be able to reproduce the bug in the same way that you are experiencing it. When testing a potential fix for the issue, contributors will use the MRP to validate that the fix is working as intended.\n- Drag and drop a ZIP archive to upload it (max 10 MB). **Do not select another field until the project is done uploading.**\n- **Note for C# users:** If your issue is *not* C#-specific, please upload a minimal reproduction project written in GDScript. This will make it easier for contributors to reproduce the issue locally as not everyone has a .NET setup available. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3027054710/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3115396008","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108188#issuecomment-3115396008","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108188","id":3115396008,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65sSuo","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-25T00:22:27Z","updated_at":"2025-07-25T00:22:27Z","body":"As ATS says, this needs a proper MRP though that should be easy to create.\n\nDo keep in mind that in stereo rendering, keeping the text the same pixel size will result in your brain processing this as growing/continually changing size, as you move around. Which will likely be very uncomfortable.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3115396008/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3166282174","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108188#issuecomment-3166282174","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108188","id":3166282174,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68uaG-","user":{"login":"DungenRobot","id":104450078,"node_id":"U_kgDOBjnIHg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104450078?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DungenRobot","html_url":"https://github.com/DungenRobot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DungenRobot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DungenRobot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DungenRobot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DungenRobot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DungenRobot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DungenRobot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DungenRobot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DungenRobot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DungenRobot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T01:18:09Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T01:18:09Z","body":"I ran into this issue as well for Sprite3D. Here's the script I used as a workaround:\n\n```gdscript\n@export\nvar cursor_size = 1.0\n\n@onready\nvar camera = get_viewport().get_camera_3d()\n\n\nfunc distance_to_camera() -> float:\n\treturn camera.get_camera_transform().origin.distance_to(global_position)\n\n\nfunc _process(_delta):\n\tpixel_size = 0.001 * cursor_size * distance_to_camera()\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3166282174/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3182097498","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108188#issuecomment-3182097498","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108188","id":3182097498,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69qvRa","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-13T04:01:19Z","updated_at":"2025-08-13T04:01:19Z","body":"Interesting. The code that applies the fixed size can be found here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/scene/resources/material.cpp#L1368\n\nBasically it adds the following to the shader:\n```\n// Scale by depth.\nfloat sc = -(MODELVIEW_MATRIX)[3].z;\nMODELVIEW_MATRIX[0] *= sc;\nMODELVIEW_MATRIX[1] *= sc;\nMODELVIEW_MATRIX[2] *= sc;\n```\n\nSo that is pretty solid, it will correctly scale up the object depending on distance from camera.\nMaybe there is an argument for trying `float sc = length(MODELVIEW_MATRIX[3]);` and see if that improves it.\n\nYou can easily test it by converting your material to a shader material (it will create a shader with the shader code Godot generates), and you could change that line of code.\n\nThat would also be the workaround if this works and we decide the cost is too great to support an edge case. Though I don't think it will makes much performance difference. Assuming I'm on the right track here :P","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3182097498/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3186267038","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108188#issuecomment-3186267038","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108188","id":3186267038,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc696pOe","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-14T00:28:42Z","updated_at":"2025-08-14T00:28:42Z","body":"@clayjohn we've validated that what I wrote in the comment above is correct. Just using the Z distance to scale the billboard adjusts the size incorrectly. In normal desktop games the effect is hardly noticeable but in VR stereoscopic rendering provides more information to the brain and it interprets the billboard growing/shrinking just by moving your head. To quote Mark Watney: Pythagoras is a d..... :)\n\nThe question now is, do we accept doing the more accurate length calculation to solve this edge case, or do we want to keep the more performant using just the z value and just tell VR devs to create a custom shader (or do we add a switch for this?).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3186267038/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3186308971","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108188#issuecomment-3186308971","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108188","id":3186308971,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc696zdr","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-14T00:53:04Z","updated_at":"2025-08-14T00:53:04Z","body":"There are many places in the scene shader where we switched from using .z to using actual length. I think actual length would be fine here. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3186308971/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3274676904","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108188#issuecomment-3274676904","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108188","id":3274676904,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7DL5qo","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url